WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.820
We have a voicemail number and this is a very
interesting question that came in today.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.450
Take a listen to this.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.070
Hi, David.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:13.679
Given that you're in the public spotlight
and you do a lot of critical commentary of

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:19.269
public figures, whether we're talking about,
you know, politicians or authors or speakers

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.550
or whatever it may be.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:25.400
Do you ever have people that try to sue you
where they're like, oh, you're slandering

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.400
me?

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.289
You know, what you're publishing here is libelous
if you ever have people to try to silence

00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:31.289
you in that way.

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:32.770
And if so, how do you deal with it?

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.590
The answer is yes.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:39.730
And the details I've been advised by counsel
not to discuss yet.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:45.860
So I've alluded to this before, that there
is a big story about this type of thing that

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.820
I want to tell.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.030
And my lawyer has said he would not tell it
yet.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.980
And it's I don't even want to say the specific
circumstances precipitating that.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:58.300
But, yes, that type of thing has happened.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:02.950
I have a story that would shock and appall
a lot of people in the audience.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:06.510
And I hope to be able to tell it someday soon.

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:10.330
You'll know when I do, believe me, on the
bonus show today.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:14.610
Pat producer Pat had a fiasco at 4:00 a.m.
last night.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.780
OK, I'm going to tell you about it on the
bonus show.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.540
We will also talk about ways different people
are dealing with the Corona virus isolation.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:27.090
Infowars has finally been kicked off what
maybe was its last platform.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:31.420
And we will also talk about the erosion of
deep literacy.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.810
All of this and more on today's bonus show.

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:41.940
Join me there by becoming a member at Joint
Packman dot com or a patron at Patry on dot

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.930
com slash David Pakman check.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:44.030
The David Pakman Show at David Pakman dot
com.

